      "expected": {
        "required": [
          {
            "file": "utils.go",
            "range": {
              "start": {
                "line": 9,
                "column": 6
              },
              "end": {
                "line": 9,
                "column": 18
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "rationale": "Source review: main.go declares a variable with utils.UtilityClass, whose type declaration is the identifier on utils.go line 9. The range was checked against the source token rather than copied as an opaque tool snapshot."
